    voice "voice/anton/1day/049. Niczego.ogg"
    Ant "It's nothing, just..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_68c8276b:


    "Olya ran up to the table, her eyes round, and asked:"


translate english anton_room_continue1_4745e53d:



    voice "voice/olya/31 O.ogg"
    Oly "You stole something and hid it there?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_c57157fb:



    voice "voice/olya/31A O.ogg"
    Oly "Are you a thief?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_f18b002b:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/Chto glup.ogg"
    Ant "What? Don't be stupid!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_f9a49866:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/Nichego ya ne kral.ogg"
    Ant "I didn't steal anything..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_16049a45:


    "A clear image came to mind: that mitten, hanging from a tree branch."


translate english anton_room_continue1_0847736b:


    "What if I did steal it after all?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_9fd26262:


    "From the forest, from the tilted figure, standing behind black trees?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_0c6c169e:


    "Olya could be selfish and stubborn when she wanted."


translate english anton_room_continue1_575247d4:



    voice "voice/olya/32 O.ogg"
    Oly "Then show me!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_153004f5:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/Poklyanis.ogg"
    Ant "Swear that you won't tell anyone, then I'll show you."


translate english anton_room_continue1_3c710558:


    "Olya wore a plotting smile."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f1e84bd6:



    voice "voice/olya/33 O.ogg"
    Oly "I swear on mom's heart!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_dd34fa87:


    "An oath she heard in one of the movies about the {u}\"pioneers\"{/u} we've watched."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f14b339b:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/052. Ne gov.ogg"
    Ant "Don't say things like that."


translate english anton_room_continue1_59db0e90:


    "Olya nodded and made a gesture with her hand, locking her mouth with an imaginary key."


translate english anton_room_continue1_151fdc3e:


    "She was filled with curiosity that was splashing in her giant eyes."


translate english anton_room_continue1_95e0fc75:


    "I opened the drawer and Olya leaned in, holding her breath."


translate english anton_room_continue1_5d3106eb:


    "It looked like there was not just a simple mitten, but some sort of exotic critter."


translate english anton_room_continue1_10fc1ed4:



    voice "voice/olya/34 O.ogg"
    Oly "Is this... someone's mitten...?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_5c6556ae:


    "She said that as if she couldn't understand what she saw."


translate english anton_room_continue1_36dd0ea1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/053. Odin m.ogg"
    Ant "A certain boy lost it... and got lost himself."


translate english anton_room_continue1_0430965e:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/053.Teper.ogg"
    Ant "Now you do understand how dangerous it is for kids to wander into the forest, right?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_51931172:



    voice "voice/olya/35 O.ogg"
    Oly "He must be really cold out there."


translate english anton_room_continue1_e4100711:



    voice "voice/olya/36 O.ogg"
    Oly "Will they find him?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_37d75390:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/Obyazatelno.ogg"
    Ant "They will."


translate english anton_room_continue1_42f0dce5:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/Uchastkoviy.ogg"
    Ant "The police are going house to house, showing his photo to everybody."


translate english anton_room_continue1_e67a3621_1:


    "Olya traversed the room with care and pressed her tiny palms against the window."


translate english anton_room_continue1_8649a6cf:



    voice "voice/olya/37 O.ogg"
    Oly "And why are they going to the houses, and not the forest?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_79bad9bb_1:



    voice "voice/olya/38 O.ogg"
    Oly "Are they scared?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_3bd0e75a_1:


    "The question caught me off guard."


translate english anton_room_continue1_1761c2e4_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/043. Milici.ogg"
    Ant "The police aren't scared of anything."


translate english anton_room_continue1_760126b0:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/043. I les.ogg"
    Ant "They've already scouted the forest..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_fcff63cd:


    "'Yeah, right!', - flashed in my clouded mind."


translate english anton_room_continue1_bddb8d9e:


    "Did they really check every nook and cranny, where darkness, cold, and whispers of icy branches dwell?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_867ffd18:


    "If that's the case, how did they miss the mitten?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_3481733f:


    "Or did it appear later... for me?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_3c1aed29_1:


    "I changed the topic."


translate english anton_room_continue1_aa6a3d99_1:


    "As if trying to get Olya as far away as possible from the forest thicket."


translate english anton_room_continue1_a7ab0e5b_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/044. Esli ja.ogg"
    Ant "We may get a reward if I go and find this boy by myself."


translate english anton_room_continue1_0d7bd550_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/044. Kuczu v.ogg"
    Ant "A lot of stuff, like in the 'Wheel of Fortune'."


translate english anton_room_continue1_8987564e_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/044. Klevo.ogg"
    Ant "Sounds cool, right?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_2ed51c80_1:


    "Olya wasn't listening to me."


translate english anton_room_continue1_eadf4747:


    "She was piercing the forest with incredibly adult eyes, uncharacteristic for her."


translate english anton_room_continue1_9a2edb83_1:



    voice "voice/olya/26 O.ogg"
    Oly "What if the owl got him...?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_2622af20_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/045. Erunda.ogg"
    Ant "Nonsense!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_c223c2ec_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/045. Ne mozh.ogg"
    Ant "An owl won't be able to lift a human."


translate english anton_room_continue1_3d61b29c_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/045. No vot.ogg"
    Ant "But you know what..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_57dacf1d:


    "I was picking my words with utmost care. I forced them out of my overexerted brain."


translate english anton_room_continue1_a5b5ba35_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/046.Ty v le.ogg"
    Ant "Stay away from the forest. I think it's..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_939392ab_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/046.Kak by.ogg"
    Ant "How should I put it... It's cursed or something."


translate english anton_room_continue1_7f782eac_1:



    voice "voice/olya/27 O.ogg"
    Oly "Just like in a fairy tale?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_883b488f_1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/047. Net. S.ogg"
    Ant "No. More like in that spooky tape our parents hide from us."


translate english anton_room_continue1_88cbc050_1:


    "Olya shivered and stole a glance at the window."


translate english anton_room_continue1_69148127:



    voice "voice/olya/39 O.ogg"
    Oly "I saw you running away..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_69602769:



    voice "voice/olya/40 O.ogg"
    Oly "Someone was chasing you?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_dd45a540:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/054. Net_ p.ogg"
    Ant "No, it's just... I was hurrying back home so mom won't be worried."


translate english anton_room_continue1_d6e620e7_1:


    "As I looked at my sister, my heart was tearing apart."


translate english anton_room_continue1_24dc5172_1:


    "She was so fragile! It was so easy to stifle her light!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_27167954:


    "A gust of wind – and her small fire would be gone."


translate english anton_room_continue1_22f5b39f:



    voice "voice/olya/41 O.ogg"
    Oly "You're lucky."


translate english anton_room_continue1_d434937e:



    voice "voice/olya/42 O.ogg"
    Oly "Mom won't even let me go outside."


translate english anton_room_continue1_1945f723:



    voice "voice/olya/43 O.ogg"
    Oly "I'm like a princess in the tower. Can't go anywhere."


translate english anton_room_continue1_68c5df3e:



    voice "voice/olya/44 O.ogg"
    Oly "I'll die from boredom here..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_b18c2cfb:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/055. Ne pri.ogg"
    Ant "You're wrong!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_9b15dc70:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/055. Ot sku.ogg"
    Ant "No one has ever died of boredom."


translate english anton_room_continue1_90564d52:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/055.U tebja.ogg"
    Ant "And you have me and your cartoons, and mom and dad will be good to each other soon."


translate english anton_room_continue1_4a0bd3bf:



    voice "voice/olya/45 O.ogg"
    Oly "You know what I would wish for on my next birthday?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_662d23a0:



    voice "voice/olya/46 O.ogg"
    Oly "I'd wish for mom and dad to turn into children so we could go and play together like we used to!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_5f2b15a0:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/056. Aga_a.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah, and if you'd make them as small as bugs, we could place them into a little box..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f7331cc0:



    voice "voice/olya/47A O.ogg"
    "Olya giggled and tugged at my sleeve."


translate english anton_room_continue1_c4d722aa:



    voice "voice/olya/47 O.ogg"
    Oly "Tosha, let's go watch Alladin."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f4b6b0f4:


    "Fatigue won over my desire to be with my little sister. I was washed over by some sort of heinous apathy."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f9052e71:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/057. Vymota.ogg"
    Ant "I'm too tired. I don't want to."


translate english anton_room_continue1_ba9816a2:



    voice "voice/olya/48 O.ogg"
    Oly "Come on!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_3cf11092:



    voice "voice/olya/49 O.ogg"
    Oly "It's so boring alone and mom is always busy."


translate english anton_room_continue1_6e06a98c:



    voice "voice/olya/50 O.ogg"
    Oly "We can pick a cartoon you haven't seen before."


translate english anton_room_continue1_103b7602:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/058. Da ja v.ogg"
    Ant "I know all of our tapes by heart at this point..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_fee67e3e:



    voice "voice/olya/51 O.ogg"
    Oly "Not all of them! You haven't watched 'Peter Pan'!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_50b615f3:



    voice "voice/olya/52 O.ogg"
    Oly "Remember how you fell asleep in the middle of it...?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_0d609c0d:



    voice "voice/olya/53 O.ogg"
    Oly "And so much happens after that... Let's go, let's go!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_b973d4b1:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/059. Davai.ogg"
    Ant "Maybe a bit later."


translate english anton_room_continue1_2eda64c7:



    voice "voice/olya/54 O.ogg"
    Oly "Should I tell you how it ends?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_5a062e9b:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/060. Utrom rasskazes.ogg"
    Ant "Let's leave that for tomorrow."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f0493ead:



    voice "voice/olya/55 O.ogg"
    Oly "I won't tell you tomorrow!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_bda6d98b:



    voice "voice/olya/56 O.ogg"
    Oly "I know! Let's play hide-n-seek!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_cb34e464:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/061. Net Ol.ogg"
    Ant "No, Olya."


translate english anton_room_continue1_c6a0c137:



    voice "voice/olya/57 O.ogg"
    Oly "Then draw me a dino."


translate english anton_room_continue1_804a1c62:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/062. Olja bl.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, please..."


translate english anton_room_continue1_fc4af113:



    voice "voice/olya/58 O.ogg"
    Oly "Draw it! Draw it!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_292a854c:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/063. Da ost.ogg"
    Ant "Leave me alone already!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_7d9c652c:


    "I blurted it out without thinking. And then I was immediately taken aback."


translate english anton_room_continue1_891a694c:


    "I'd never screamed at my little sister like that."


translate english anton_room_continue1_d154b21f:


    "Olya stared at me in shock."


translate english anton_room_continue1_22e97138:


    "Her lips started trembling, a precursor to tears."


translate english anton_room_continue1_5cf896d9:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/064. Gadliv.ogg"
    "My chest was seething with disgust and embarrassment. What's happening to me?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_58fa8dcd:


    "I hurried to prevent Olya from crying."


translate english anton_room_continue1_5e8e519d:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/065. Ladno.ogg"
    Ant "Alright, you win, let's go watch cartoons for a bit."


translate english anton_room_continue1_17bfc0bc:



    voice "voice/olya/59 O.ogg"
    Oly "I don't wanna."


translate english anton_room_continue1_832837f6:


    "I came up to her. Put my hand on her soft head."


translate english anton_room_continue1_3e9dfd97:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/066. Poidem.ogg"
    Ant "Let's go."


translate english anton_room_continue1_501aa3f8:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/066. Pitera.ogg"
    Ant "Let's go watch Peter Pan."


translate english anton_room_continue1_786e5b97:



    voice "voice/olya/60 O.ogg"
    Oly "Boo! You'll fall asleep again."


translate english anton_room_continue1_a20062ab:


    "I smiled and lifted her chin. Her eyes were wet and felt bottomless."


translate english anton_room_continue1_e21d5194:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/067. Ne usn.ogg"
    Ant "I promise I won't."


translate english anton_room_continue1_ca8c21cb:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/067. A poto.ogg"
    Ant "And I'll draw you a full Triceratops later."


translate english anton_room_continue1_d85f996d:



    voice "voice/olya/61A O.ogg"
    Oly "Hurray!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_32a5fd01:



    voice "voice/olya/61 O.ogg"
    Oly "Tripe... cire... pops!"


translate english anton_room_continue1_dbc707a9:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/068. Nu pochti.ogg"
    Ant "Well, close enough."


translate english anton_room_continue1_16564592:


    "Olya rubbed her eyes with a sleeve of her pajamas and a shining smile returned to her face."


translate english anton_room_continue1_fba82afa:



    voice "voice/olya/63 O.ogg"
    Oly "I'll go ask mom for condensed milk and bread and you rewind the tape."


translate english anton_room_continue1_13c5b14b:



    voice "voice/olya/64 O.ogg"
    Oly "The bread is fresh, just how you like it."


translate english anton_room_continue1_5329cbdc:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/069. Nesi t.ogg"
    Ant "Alright, just be careful not to spill the milk."


translate english anton_room_continue1_4c74ba5e:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/069.Opjat r.ogg"
    Ant "Or you'll be yelled at again."


translate english anton_room_continue1_21ff56e5:



    voice "voice/olya/65 O.ogg"
    Oly "Wanna bet I won't spill it?"


translate english anton_room_continue1_b4b03205:



    voice "voice/olya/66 O.ogg"
    Oly "The tape is somewhere in the nightstand, look for it."


translate english anton_room_continue1_f4354cc5:


    "Olya disappeared into the doorway, and I dragged my feet into the neighboring room."


translate english bunny_olya_room_circle_553eee2f:


    "The scary window where Olya sees that accursed owl every night, lurking in the dark."


translate english bunny_olya_room_circle_235dbac4:


    "Olya keeps curtains open during the day, but as soon as the twilight comes she shuts them tight, so she wouldn't see the pair of hungry eyes outside."


translate english bunny_olya_room_circle_d5388375:


    "There was no owl, just a dark forest."


translate english bunny_olya_room_bear_e38bff48:


    "Olya's countless toys."


translate english bunny_olya_room_bear_99efa8ea:


    "An old teddy bear is the main attraction here. Olya doesn't sleep without it."


translate english bunny_olya_room_bear_6e5890ea:


    "And she digs her nose into its fur when she sleeps."


translate english bunny_olya_room_bear_5d48aa1d:


    "A teddy bear."


translate english bunny_olya_room_pig_5e7c899a:


    "A piggy bank."


translate english bunny_olya_room_pig_fa66152e:


    "Olya is saving money for a real puppy because dad said that taking care of him will take a lot of money."


translate english bunny_olya_room_pig_364ddebd:


    "Too bad I don't have a coin on me."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_381e34e4:


    "The old Photon TV was gathering dust in the corner."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_51006047:


    "All that was left was clicking the button on the front panel."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_ca1908d2:


    "The tube warmed up and familiar white noise started dancing on the black screen."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_3aaae6a5:


    "I almost reached out to turn on the VCR, when the noise calmed down and a blurry image appeared for a moment."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_d62c7651:


    "It was a dark Taiga forest, just like the one outside my window. The picture split the screen in half."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_c9dac7ae:


    "Something creepy resembling human speech was coming out of the speaker."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_0b8d0618:


    "Just a few moments later the scenery was again overshadowed by noise."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_d7e6412c:


    "Did it catch some rogue signal?"


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_19d7decc:


    "Local TV station only really showed Soviet cartoons, and even that was pretty rare."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_d54beb89:


    "And only just recently I used to always watch Robotech before school."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_7d194fa5:


    "It was so awesome..."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_f0cdf1b8:


    "Maybe I should tinker with the antenna? What if I catch this channel again?"


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_de06b277:


    "On the other hand..."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_b77db56e:


    "Olya had asked me to find the tape."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_240b8ecb:


    "It wouldn't be nice to disappoint her."


translate english bunny_day1_olya_room_photon_90440bef:


    "But in my sleepy state... I didn't have the strength to do all of it."


translate english bunny1_find1_31347822:


    "I sifted through the shelves full of dolls and blue hippos from Kinder Surprise."


translate english bunny1_find1_94a88120:


    "I found the tape I needed thanks to its shabby spine."


translate english bunny1_find1_aeb2f9de:


    "I got the black rectangle from its box."


translate english bunny1_find1_33f907a4:


    "The tape inside it rustled while rewinding to the beginning. This rustle was lulling me to sleep."


translate english bunny1_find1_4e71cb9a:


    "Drowsiness attacked me while I was squatting before the TV."


translate english bunny1_find1_25a40d77:


    "Images whirled in my head: me and Olya flying above the forest, tumbling in the soft clouds."


translate english bunny1_find1_01c2a7eb:


    "My little sister is laughing, but her smile becomes more and more forced with every passing second."


translate english bunny1_find1_1472e7bd:


    "I notice that the clouds underneath us part, baring the bristly pine tops."


translate english bunny1_find1_102718e7:


    "Swampy darkness slurped among the trees. The wings are no longer able to hold us and Olya..."


translate english bunny1_find1_b5ce6583:



    voice "voice/olya/67 O.ogg"
    Oly "You haven't started without me, have you?"


translate english bunny1_find1_0b1b3586:


    "My sister brought the tray with unevenly cut bread and a whole can of condensed milk."


translate english bunny1_find1_9f6ebe0f:


    "I rubbed my eyes."


translate english bunny1_find1_79a82788:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/070. Net. S.ogg"
    Ant "No. Come, sit."


translate english bunny1_find1_ebbfe0b7:



    voice "voice/olya/68 O.ogg"
    Oly "Mom and dad are arguing again."


translate english bunny1_find1_b39435a4:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/071. U nih.ogg"
    Ant "They're going through rough times."


translate english bunny1_find1_8dc76298:



    voice "voice/olya/69 O.ogg"
    Oly "Rough times are lame."


translate english bunny1_find1_dabd84cb:


    "On the screen, Wendy was hiding Peter Pan's shadow into the dresser. Olya was entertained by the cartoonish dog Nana."


translate english bunny1_find1_9b84c078:



    voice "voice/olya/70 O.ogg"
    Oly "Maybe mom and dad will buy us a dog too?"


translate english bunny1_find1_39efac92:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/072. Aga ka.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah, right."


translate english bunny1_find1_793d5a81:



    voice "voice/olya/71 O.ogg"
    Oly "I'll have my own dog in the Neverland! And a cat! And a parrot!"


translate english bunny1_find1_836d035c:


    "Olya smeared a slice of bread with a thick layer of condensed milk and handed it to me."


translate english bunny1_find1_7f654277:



    voice "voice/olya/72 O.ogg"
    Oly "Have you lost all of your baby teeth?"


translate english bunny1_find1_809775ca:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/072. Koneczn.ogg"
    Ant "Obviously."


translate english bunny1_find1_96f45d17:


    "Olya frowned, deep in thought."


translate english bunny1_find1_dfc59649:



    voice "voice/olya/73 O.ogg"
    Oly "Peter Pan has baby teeth."


translate english bunny1_find1_ac0228e5:



    voice "voice/olya/74 O.ogg"
    Oly "What if they won't let you go to his land with adult teeth?"


translate english bunny1_find1_120481a9:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/073. My czto.ogg"
    Ant "We'll think of something."


translate english bunny1_find1_ed32c63e:



    voice "voice/olya/75 O.ogg"
    Oly "We'll ask dad to alter your age in the passport."


translate english bunny1_find1_1f50fa9e:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/074. S czego.ogg"
    Ant "And why would dad forge documents?"


translate english bunny1_find1_50a2f9db:


    "Olya took a bite from the sandwich and started talking with her mouth full:"


translate english bunny1_find1_529e73c8:



    voice "voice/olya/76 O.ogg"
    Oly "He wiww! I hewd mom thay he did that befow."


translate english bunny1_find1_629bf585:



    voice "voice/anton/1day/075. Smotri.ogg"
    Ant "You'll grow ears as big as Dumbo's."


translate english bunny1_find1_0d6dbe87:


    "Olya got worried and touched her ear. I smiled to myself."


translate english bunny1_find1_e2e34287:


    "My little sister was silent now – she just devoured bread, watching the adventures of Peter Pan, Tinkerbell and James Hook."


translate english bunny1_find1_f1651186:


    "As if she got sucked into the fairy tale Neverland."


translate english bunny1_find1_4302db11:


    "To be honest, I also imagined myself there, in a land where one never ages, where no one argues over little things, where no one listens to fights and the sound of broken plates at night."


translate english bunny1_pref1_654a450d:


    "The picture finally cleared up."


translate english bunny1_pref1_a3d9801c:


    "But the moment I rejoiced at finding that weird signal again, the TV started coughing, a voice barely coming through the cacophony."


translate english bunny1_pref1_38035035:



    voice "voice/dictor/01 D.ogg"
    Dic "He was often seen..."


translate english bunny1_pref1_1317f9b2:



    voice "voice/dictor/02 D.ogg"
    Dic "At the moment when..."


translate english bunny1_pref1_c06c411e:


    "Small snowy hills were lined up on the screen, pierced with rickety crosses, and a male voice was narrating with a slow, mournful voice."


translate english bunny1_pref1_529a87cd:



    voice "voice/dictor/03 D.ogg"
    Dic "It was a pitch-black night at the cemetery."


translate english bunny1_pref1_8feef966:



    voice "voice/dictor/04 D.ogg"
    Dic "In that fateful dark time little Senya met her fate at the face of a monstrous thicket dweller."


translate english bunny1_pref1_07406823:



    voice "voice/dictor/05 D.ogg"
    Dic "The locals call him none other than 'The Forest Master'"


translate english bunny1_pref1_9b504889:


    "I froze, and did my best not to move, as if by doing that I could scare away the narrator. I listened closely to his every word."


translate english bunny1_pref1_a0e7cdc5:



    voice "voice/dictor/06 D.ogg"
    Dic "The beast dealt with the helpless girl in a masterful manner..."


translate english staruha1_6ce34d39:


    "The camera panned across the snow with something black spilled over it, looking for ragged pieces of cloth that were thrown around all over the place."


translate english staruha1_90dcdea9:


    "I didn't want to think whether Senya's remains were wrapped in there, so I shut my eyes without thinking."


translate english staruha1_1d5905d5:


    "The voice continued:"


translate english staruha1_a083d8ee:



    voice "voice/dictor/07 D.ogg"
    Dic "Wolves are rare guests in these parts."


translate english staruha1_001e196c:



    voice "voice/dictor/08 D.ogg"
    Dic "Here's what Tamara, the old woman that lives in a nearby crypt, had to say."


translate english staruha1_50acb7de:



    voice "voice/tamara/00T.ogg"
